📣 Announcing the immediate availability of:

- PHP 8.2.32
- PHP 8.3.32
- PHP 8.4.23
- PHP 8.5.8

‼️ These address the following security issues:

- Memory corruption in openssl_encrypt with AES-WRAP-PAD
- Uninitialized memory in the path buffer growth in Lexbor
- Segfault in file_get_contents w/ a https URL and a proxy set

📝 https://www.php.net/ChangeLog-8.php
🎁 https://www.php.net/downloads
